}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List Volunteer Feedback Submissions
  
  Returns a paginated list of volunteer feedback submissions. Results can be paginated via `page` and `limit` query parameters. Supports full-text search via PostgreSQL GIN index.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default | Description                                                                                             |
  |-----------|--------|----------|---------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`     | Page number (1-indexed, integer ≥ 1)                                                                    |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`    | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                                                                         |
  | search    | string | No       | —       | Full-text search query. When provided, cache is bypassed and results are matched against the GIN index. |
  
  ### Searchable Fields
  
  | Field                  | Weight |
  |------------------------|--------|
  | `firstName`            | A      |
  | `surname`              | A      |
  | `programVolunteered`   | A      |
  | `volunteerDuration`    | A      |
  | `wouldRecommend`       | D      |
  | `waysProgramHelped`    | C      |
  | `activitiesInvolvedIn` | C      |
  | `skillsGained`         | C      |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of volunteer feedback records.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [ ... ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25,
        "totalPages": 2
      },
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                         |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. non-numeric `page`). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                            |
}
